# The image of `Dockerfile` (the OPA decision service) needs only the
# policy and the shims it copies: everything else stays out of the build
# context. Re-include only what a `COPY` needs, right below `*`
*
!engines/opa/policy/
!shims/common.py
!shims/opa_front.py
!shims/opa_service.py

# Local secrets (e.g. `.env`, `.env.local`, `.envrc`) and other secret files
# must never reach a build, also not within re-included paths. Keep these
# lines last: a later re-include (`!...`) would override them
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.git-credentials
**/.pypirc
**/credentials*.json
**/.netrc
